    "summary": {
      "name": "Cogent Security",
      "legal_name": "Cogent Security, Inc.",
      "description": "Cogent is an applied AI lab building AI systems for enterprise cybersecurity teams. We focus on cybersecurity because it affects everyone\u2014the reliability of the services we use, the privacy of our data, and the safety of the organizations we depend on. Our mission is to prevent breaches using autonomous AI systems that continuously secure systems against AI-armed adversaries operating at machine speed. Founded by researchers and operators from Google DeepMind, Abnormal Security, and Coinbase. Backed by Greylock Partners.",
      "overview": "Cogent Security provides an AI-driven platform that automates vulnerability management by continuously ingesting context, prioritizing risks, and coordinating remediation actions with minimal manual effort from security teams. Its technology uses autonomous agents to highlight key vulnerabilities, suggest high-impact fixes, and generate program-level reporting to help organizations respond to security threats more effectively. The platform integrates with existing security and IT tools to contextualize assets and feeds, supporting end-to-end vulnerability lifecycle workflows. Cogent Security\u2019s solution is designed to reduce the time and manual work associated with identifying, triaging, and addressing vulnerabilities while aligning actions with business risk priorities. The company\u2019s approach aims to shift traditional vulnerability practices toward more dynamic risk-aware operations.",
